Install dependencies : 
=========================
sudo apt update
sudo apt install build-essential meson ninja-build libnuma-dev python3-pyelftools pkg-config


Build DPDK:
===========================
cd ~/OpenSrc-Codes/dpdk
meson setup build
ninja -C build


Install System wide
=========================
sudo ninja -C build install
sudo ldconfig


Link your program:
===========================
gcc my_app.c -o my_app \
-I$HOME/OpenSrc-Codes/dpdk/build/include \
-L$HOME/OpenSrc-Codes/dpdk/build/lib \
-lrte_eal -lrte_mbuf -lrte_ring -lrte_mempool -lrte_ethdev \
-lpthread -ldl -lnuma -lm